  - {fileID: 4900000, guid: 59b7625afe4a14727ac0fd2283e17c33, type: 3}
  animations:
  - key: jump
    description: When character is very active and happy, or feels the need to jump
      once.
    clip: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 0125249b519924e77ba7380b9983951b, type: 3}
  - key: failed
    description: When something doesn't happens as he want or he failed on something
    clip: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 90494884d9be94c3784d20cda2d1fde7, type: 3}
  - key: relief
    description: When he finishes an atctivity he though he wouldn't make it
    clip: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 6ab642b632b7e424e827ba344ad082bd, type: 3}
  - key: stretch
    description: When he's a long time talking and is relaxed, but trying to focus
    clip: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 0ddb45ac139134fc08e2fc7e3e1c2aa1, type: 3}
  - key: look-around
    description: When he needs to look for something in his spacial suroundings
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: db2e9d411881d4b2393d7270e57d78c5, type: 3}
  - key: introduce
    description: When first time talking to someone in a polite way
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 42aacd68831b84dd3a27fe37f7f9a306, type: 3}
  - key: laugh
    description: When he though something was funny or silly
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 020b4d971d2574da4bae59bbea100288, type: 3}
  - key: look-back
    description: When he listens to something in his back or when people tell him
      to look behind.
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 9efca975340cc4bfea4b694b1e230e80, type: 3}
  - key: phone-call
    description: When he needs to talk to someone immediatly or pretending to talk
      with someone from the conkist team.
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: c9965ef41e9144b3385143edb1cd4c38, type: 3}
  - key: texting-phone
    description: 
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 3020414eb41394b0083fcbb7cb70c2d5, type: 3}
  - key: dismiss
    description: When he thinks the conversation is heading for a subject he discourages
      or disbelieves. Also used when people strongly compliments and he uses his
      modesty
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 9ecf3f0ecf8f14ceba9bfa3bab5496a6, type: 3}
  - key: present
    description: When something is displayed on his right side or when he is arguing
      something.
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: d9f0167d310bd45158a13af789ace296, type: 3}
  - key: wave-hand
    description: When he greets someone in a friendly way
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 0bd470ef916bf4848a809574eab5e9b0, type: 3}
  - key: shrug
    description: When he don't care about the subject or don't know what to do
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 28d46125fdefb4d91b2c699def592c00, type: 3}
  - key: look-far-away
    description: When he is trying to look something is in the other side of the
      screen, as if was trying to see the other person or what is presenting visualy
    clip: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 12022dd7b9529457eac04607f40a97a2, type: 3}
  - key: none
    description: When none of the situations above fits
    clip: {fileID: 0}
